 broadcasts and concerts.\n\nFans from 60 countries around the globe are meeting K-POP artists through VENTA X's immersive 8K 3D VR content, as if they are right in front of their eyes.\n\nDiscover the latest 8K 3D VR content of K-POP artists, updated weekly!\n\n[VENTA X Original content: 8K 3D VR MUSIC CINEMA]\n\u00b7 A performance that unfolds the artist's songs with movie-like stories.\n\u00b7 VR-optimized performances and immersive CG.\n\n[VENTA X K-POP Series content: 8K 3D VR performance VOD]\n\u00b7 Experience the diverse aspects of K-POP artists, including performances and variety shows, in a three-dimensional VR content.", "short_description": "Enjoy K-POP content produced in immersive 8K 3D VR! You can watch for extended periods without experiencing motion sickness, and the content is shot from an eye-level perspective, allowing you to have an experience of making eye contact with K-POP artists. There's a plethora of content available for you to enjoy!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "00_Logo(Transparent).png", "id": "1444402182919663", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003255_1444402186252996_7014711383928885591_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qoZkD_6IACMQ7kNvwH7b6IH&_nc_oc=AdkKo6csNBXawBPHJnJlngMyC6nCWxpy4hRwExD6wZab1YrhC5AIk6OMqIiUZZR-qUw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfycfC2QJ9PUk51EH0zjBf0N9AvxREVuiJ6IfLtiV8Yevw&oe=69AAB29D"}, {"file_name": "03_portrait.png", "id": "1171362250588035", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031467_1171362257254701_2035722783743461690_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=pFaY568h2PwQ7kNvwGe2j1u&_nc_oc=AdnH5KjdyY1O_2Nlqqsp1W_Evj9zMM1HqqXEBvr5N8E78UGRPmmqOjTZdTs59GpWspI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afz4fUe86FU_EgB6nBmfCOyxnhcpLImZ1qmago5ZFPtHQg&oe=69AAB6A0"}, {"file_name": "01_Hero.png", "id"