 new features and changes coming in the update.\n\n[CHANGES]\n- Removed the sound effects of the object (gyro).\n\n\u203b In addition, we have fixed some minor bugs that occurred during operation.\n\nThank you.\nVENTA X\n\n\u25cf VENTA X Official Homepage - https://www.venta-x.com/\n\u25cf VENTA X Official Twitter - https://twitter.com/VENTAX_official\n\u25cf VENTA X Official YouTube - https://www.youtube.com/@VENTA_X\n\u25cf VENTA X Official Tik Tok - https://www.tiktok.com/@ventax_official\n\n\n\uc548\ub155\ud558\uc138\uc694!\nVENTA X\uc785\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n\n\uc774\ubc88 \uc5c5\ub370\uc774\ud2b8\uc5d0\uc11c \ucd94\uac00\ub418\ub294 \uae30\ub2a5 \ubc0f \ubcc0\uacbd \uc0ac\ud56d\uc740 \uc544\ub798\uc640 \uac19\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n\n[\ubcc0\uacbd \uc0ac\ud56d]\n- \uc624\ube0c\uc81d\ud2b8(\uc790\uc774\ub85c) \ud6a8\uacfc\uc74c \uc81c\uac70\n\n\u203b \uc774 \uc678 \uc6b4\uc601\uc0c1 \ubc1c\uc0dd\ud55c \uc791\uc740 \ubc84\uadf8\ub97c \uc218\uc815\ud588\uc2b5\ub2c8\ub2e4.\n\n\uac10\uc0ac\ud569\ub2c8\ub2e4.\nVENTA X\n\n\u25cf VENTA X Official Homepage - https://www.venta-x.com/\n\u25cf VENTA X Official Twitter - https://twitter.com/VENTAX_official\n\u25cf VENTA X Official YouTube - https://www.youtube.com/@VENTA_X\n\u25cf VENTA X Official Tik Tok - https://www.tiktok.com/@ventax_official", "created_date": 1702019790, "id": "6906559246091219", "version": "0.7.285", "version_code": 54, "release_status": "RELEASED", "status": "APPROVED", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "obb_binary": null, "asset_files": {"count": 0}, "debug_symbols": {"count": 0}, "__isAppBinaryWithFileAsset": "AndroidBinary"}, {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "5370588983021594", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "8202665549813909"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_release_channels": {"nodes": []}, "change_log": null, "created_date": 1701157538, "id": "68691